"This reality series (as the name suggests) is all about temptation. Paddy McGuinness rounds up 12 Brits and plops them into a tropical jungle, which would sound alright if they weren't surviving on basic rations and survival gear. The stakes rise when the group are continuously tempted by extortionately priced items, that they have to use the shared prize money to pay for. Who will be tempted...?"]},{"tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":["The concept for the campaign came in harmony with the show's concept.  The paintings take the shape of classical Renaissance-like paintings. Featuring modern elements as a nod to temptation struggles that have been famously documented through the ages. "]},{"tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":["These paintings and the re-imagined 80's track 'Temptation' by Heaven 17 sang by choir, all serves to foreshadow the drama that's to come with the series. "]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-sbs-asym grid module-proxy"},"children":[{"tag":"figure","attrs":{"class":"module-sbs-asym__fig bg-loading"},"children":[{"tag":"picture","attrs":{"class":"base-image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","attrs":{"class":"base-image__img","src":"/assets/1740758227-the-spa-ignasi-the-line-london-bc2880deb3.webp","width":"1896","height":"1631","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","srcset":"/assets/1740758227-the-spa-ignasi-the-line-london-958d184e5d.webp 474w,/assets/1740758227-the-spa-ignasi-the-line-london-f1f0fb6a9c.webp 948w,/assets/1740758227-the-spa-ignasi-the-line-london-bc2880deb3.webp 1896w","sizes":"(max-width: 1896px) 100vw, 1896px"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"figure","attrs":{"class":"module-sbs-asym__fig bg-loading"},"children":[{"tag":"picture","attrs":{"class":"base-image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","attrs":{"class":"base-image__img","src":"/assets/1740759129-ignasi-concept-art-the-line-animation-studio-tempting-fortu-648745bb76.webp","width":"1896","height":"1630","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","srcset":"/assets/1740759129-ig